DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
6236::$$$message_0044_0000_0000$$$::"...What are you doing, Emiya?"[lr]::
6237::$$$message_0044_0000_0001$$$::"Cleaning the floor, as you can see."[lr]::
6238::$$$message_0044_0000_0002$$$::I wring the rag, which releases a stream of dirty water into the bucket.::
6239::$$$message_0044_0001_0000$$$::"I know that, but... I don't quite understand why you're cleaning our temple."[lr]::
6240::$$$message_0044_0001_0001$$$::"Oh, that."::
6241::$$$message_0044_0002_0000$$$::I was exercising earlier, going up and down the temple's stone steps to strengthen muscles I don't normally use.[lr]::
6242::$$$message_0044_0002_0001$$$::And Issei's older brother showed up.[lr]::
6243::$$$message_0044_0002_0002$$$::"Hey there, Shirou. How goes it?"[lr]::
6244::$$$message_0044_0002_0003$$$::Reikan agreed with my desire to keep my body strong, and asked me to help clean the temple.::
6245::$$$message_0044_0003_0000$$$::I was led through the mountain gate, giving Assassin a slight bow as I passed his usual guard post.::
6246::$$$message_0044_0004_0000$$$::Just when I thought Reikan might have me sweep leaves in the yard, he led me further into the temple, and...::
6247::$$$message_0044_0005_0000$$$::"And that's when he asked me to clean the temple floor."[lr]::
6248::$$$message_0044_0005_0001$$$::"Why didn't you say no?"[lr]::
6249::$$$message_0044_0005_0002$$$::"Because you guys always help me out, too. It's actually pretty fun, by the way."[lr]::
6250::$$$message_0044_0005_0003$$$::Issei sighs.[lr]::
6251::$$$message_0044_0005_0004$$$::Is he fed up with me? I'm not sure, actually.::
6252::$$$message_0044_0006_0000$$$::"I know this doesn't mean much from me, since I'm always asking you to run errands for the student council..."[lr]::
6253::$$$message_0044_0006_0001$$$::It really was just a sigh.::
6254::$$$message_0044_0007_0000$$$::"But if they ask, you'll even clean your friend's house?"[lr]::
6255::$$$message_0044_0007_0001$$$::"That depends. I cleaned Tohsaka's place before..."[lr]::
6256::$$$message_0044_0007_0002$$$::When I mention that she gave me a spare key, Issei looks utterly despondent.[lr]::
6257::$$$message_0044_0007_0003$$$::"What's wrong?"::
6258::$$$message_0044_0008_0000$$$::"No, I'm just...more dizzy than upset, finding out that not only did Tohsaka push that kind of work onto you, she's actually asked you more than once..."::
6259::$$$message_0044_0009_0000$$$::I'm Tohsaka's magecraft apprentice, though. Cleaning my mentor's house just comes with the territory.[lr]::
6260::$$$message_0044_0009_0001$$$::Cleaning up your own messes isn't just logical, it's important.::
6261::$$$message_0044_0010_0000$$$::"Pardon me. Reikan asked me to bring Emiya some refreshments...but make sure to wash your hands before you partake."[lr]::
6262::$$$message_0044_0010_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki appears holding a tray.[lr]::
6263::$$$message_0044_0010_0002$$$::I see that there's tea and snacks on it.[lr]::
6264::$$$message_0044_0010_0003$$$::I do a double take and realize that the snacks are the fancy kind you buy for guests, a cut above what I serve at home.::
6265::$$$message_0044_0011_0000$$$::"Souichirou, is Reikan back yet?"[lr]::
6266::$$$message_0044_0011_0001$$$::"Not yet. He's with a worshipper right now. He said that you and Emiya should eat."::
6267::$$$message_0044_0012_0000$$$::"Thanks. I'll wash my hands, then. Should I come back here?"[lr]::
6268::$$$message_0044_0012_0001$$$::"You must feel uncomfortable eating in front of the Buddha.[lr]::
6269::$$$message_0044_0012_0002$$$::Then come to my room. Unfortunately, the visitors' lobby is occupied."::
6270::$$$message_0044_0013_0000$$$::A bizarre scene unfolds before me.[lr]::
6271::$$$message_0044_0013_0001$$$::We sit around the tray in Mr. Kuzuki's room, sipping tea.[lr]::
6272::$$$message_0044_0013_0002$$$::Perhaps he personally served us tea because the temple put him in charge of entertaining visitors, but I just can't relax around him.::
6273::$$$message_0044_0014_0000$$$::...I scan the room. It's a plain Japanese-style room furnished with a collection of cabinets, and a ship-in-a-bottle that seems out of place.[lr]::
6274::$$$message_0044_0014_0001$$$::The bottle is the big kind you'd find European spirits in, not the typical 1.8-liter Japanese variety.[lr]::
6275::$$$message_0044_0014_0002$$$::What's in all these drawers, anyway? [l]Until now I forgot, but Mr. Kuzuki must share this room with his newlywed wife, Caster.[lr]::
6276::$$$message_0044_0014_0003$$$::I can only assume that they contain...::
6277::$$$message_0044_0015_0000$$$::"Emiya, your tea."[lr]::
6278::$$$message_0044_0015_0001$$$::Mr. Kuzuki's voice snaps me back to reality.[lr]::
6279::$$$message_0044_0015_0002$$$::I accept the warm teacup and savor its aroma.[lr]::
6280::$$$message_0044_0015_0003$$$::As I suspected, they do use some premium tea here after all.::
6281::$$$message_0044_0016_0000$$$::I taste the tea and snacks, not wanting to seem impolite.[lr]::
6282::$$$message_0044_0016_0001$$$::They really do taste different after a hard day's work. And the tea is delicious.[lr]::
6283::$$$message_0044_0016_0002$$$::I bet Saber would be happy if I took some home to share with her.::
6284::$$$message_0044_0017_0000$$$::"You look happy. Do you like the refreshments?"[lr]::
6285::$$$message_0044_0017_0001$$$::"Oh, is it showing on my face?"[lr]::
6286::$$$message_0044_0017_0002$$$::Issei nods. Mr. Kuzuki keeps drinking his tea, impassive as always.::
6287::$$$message_0044_0018_0000$$$::"I believe we still have some of the snacks left. Do you want to take some home?"[lr]::
6288::$$$message_0044_0018_0001$$$::"I feel bad, though. All I did was wipe your floors a little."[lr]::
6289::$$$message_0044_0018_0002$$$::"We don't mind at all."[lr]::
6290::$$$message_0044_0018_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=葛木01a眼鏡(中) textoff=0]Just as I'm about to accept [se storage=se188.wav]his goodwill, the door slides open.::
6291::$$$message_0044_0019_0000$$$::"Souichirou, your meal is ready[line len=2][cacheimage storage=キャスターローブ無し03b(遠)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=キャスターローブ無し03b(遠) textoff=0]Oh."[lr]::
6292::$$$message_0044_0019_0001$$$::Caster appears holding a tray. She looks confused to see me.::
6293::$$$message_0044_0020_0000$$$::"Issei, I can understand...but what is that boy doing here?"[lr]::
6294::$$$message_0044_0020_0001$$$::"Uh, stuff happened."[lr]::
6295::$$$message_0044_0020_0002$$$::That's all I feel like saying. It would be a hassle to explain the sequence of events all over again.[lr]::
6296::$$$message_0044_0020_0003$$$::[clfg rule=シャッター左から storage=キャスターローブ無し02b(遠) time=300]More importantly, I'm curious what's on the tray she set down on the table next to us. It's probably today's lunch.::
6297::$$$message_0044_0021_0000$$$::"...Did you make that, Caster?"[lr]::
6298::$$$message_0044_0021_0001$$$::"Yes. Do you have something to say about it?"[lr]::
6299::$$$message_0044_0021_0002$$$::I was just asking...::
6300::$$$message_0044_0022_0000$$$::"Is cooking, uh, difficult for you?"[lr]::
6301::$$$message_0044_0022_0001$$$::The food's burned, the juices are making a mess all over the plate... I won't get into the details, but it's a spectacle, to say the least.[lr]::
6302::$$$message_0044_0022_0002$$$::There's yellow and red where there shouldn't be, and I'm not even sure how to respond to the purple.::
6303::$$$message_0044_0023_0000$$$::"S-so what, boy!? You talk as if [font italic=true]you[font italic=false] know how to cook!"[lr]::
6304::$$$message_0044_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah. Emiya's cooking is delicious."[lr]::
6305::$$$message_0044_0023_0002$$$::Issei doesn't hesitate to interject.::
6306::$$$message_0044_0024_0000$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=300][say storage=ryu0203_cas_0040 name=キャスター][chgfg time=300 storage=キャスターローブ無し01c怒り(中) textoff=0]Why are you answering for him, Issei?"[lr]::
6307::$$$message_0044_0024_0001$$$::"Ah, well, I've eaten Emiya's cooking before."[lr]::
6308::$$$message_0044_0024_0002$$$::It would be more accurate to say he enjoys it all the time in the student council room. ::
6309::$$$message_0044_0025_0000$$$::Still, I can believe that Caster isn't good at cooking.[lr]::
6310::$$$message_0044_0025_0001$$$::She was originally a princess. As royalty, she would never have cooked for herself, so she must be trying really hard now.[lr]::
6311::$$$message_0044_0025_0002$$$::What kind of hero is known for their cooking skills, anyway?[lr]::
6312::$$$message_0044_0025_0003$$$::I guess that red one. The one with the tan skin and white hair.::
6313::$$$message_0044_0026_0000$$$::"Hm. Are you a skilled cook, Emiya?"[lr]::
6314::$$$message_0044_0026_0001$$$::"Um, I guess you could say that. I've always lived on my own, so I can at least manage the basics."[lr]::
6315::$$$message_0044_0026_0002$$$::Mr. Kuzuki looks unusually contemplative for a moment...::
6316::$$$message_0044_0027_0000$$$::"Caster. If you feel that your skills are inadequate, why don't you have Emiya give you lessons?"[lr]::
6317::$$$message_0044_0027_0001$$$::...and drops a bombshell of a suggestion.::
6318::$$$message_0044_0028_0000$$$::"[large]Huh?[rf]"[lr]::
6319::$$$message_0044_0028_0001$$$::The rest of us gasp in unison, unintentionally.[lr]::
6320::$$$message_0044_0028_0002$$$::"Only if you're both willing, of course."[lr]::
6321::$$$message_0044_0028_0003$$$::He continues as if he didn't even notice our reaction.::
6322::$$$message_0044_0029_0000$$$::"...I don't mind, if that's what you want, Souichirou..."[lr]::
6323::$$$message_0044_0029_0001$$$::"Uh."[rf][lr]::
6324::$$$message_0044_0029_0002$$$::This time, only two jaws drop. Issei and I didn't expect Caster to agree.[lr]::
6325::$$$message_0044_0029_0003$$$::All eyes turn to focus on me. They're still waiting for my answer.::
6326::$$$message_0044_0030_0000$$$::"...I don't particularly mind."[lr]::
6327::$$$message_0044_0030_0001$$$::"Then it's agreed. Please teach my wife well, Emiya."::
6328::$$$message_0044_0031_0000$$$::I leave Ryudou Temple with the snacks Issei gifted me.[lr]::
6329::$$$message_0044_0031_0001$$$::"...Hm."[lr]::
6330::$$$message_0044_0031_0002$$$::How do I put this...[lr]::
6331::$$$message_0044_0031_0003$$$::"...Life sure comes at you fast, huh?"[lr]::
6332::$$$message_0044_0031_0004$$$::What should I teach her, then...?::
906304::$$$message_9044_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah. Emiya's cooking is delicious."[r]::+